00:02:17.600 --> 00:02:18.950
From the Marquez agency, ma'am.

00:02:19.240 --> 00:02:21.560
Why do you ask for that agency if you know I don't like it?

00:02:21.760 --> 00:02:23.140
There's no other lady left.

00:02:24.950 --> 00:02:25.590
It won't work.

00:02:26.920 --> 00:02:27.800
You're fired, ma'am.

00:02:28.680 --> 00:02:29.940
No, it won't work.

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:38.120
You see? It's not going to work.

00:02:38.400 --> 00:02:40.640
It's not going to work.

00:02:40.920 --> 00:02:45.130
The hairdresser is at this hour.

00:02:45.310 --> 00:02:46.010
Not you, miss.

00:02:46.310 --> 00:02:47.110
I told you at four.

00:02:47.660 --> 00:02:48.340
Now it's five.

00:02:48.740 --> 00:02:50.920
It's five, miss.

00:02:51.280 --> 00:02:53.060
Look, it's this hour.

00:03:31.660 --> 00:03:31.980
Where is she?

00:03:33.080 --> 00:03:34.580
Where is she?

00:03:34.980 --> 00:03:35.900
They are...

00:03:36.210 --> 00:03:37.210
No, daughter, no.

00:03:37.330 --> 00:03:37.950
Don't worry.

00:03:38.430 --> 00:03:39.570
Get the cars out.

00:03:39.710 --> 00:03:40.170
Yes.

00:03:40.950 --> 00:03:41.910
Don't worry.

00:03:42.250 --> 00:03:44.050
That mucama is here for that, do you understand?

00:03:44.350 --> 00:03:44.490
No.

00:03:44.930 --> 00:03:46.030
To make her do gymnastics.

00:03:46.450 --> 00:03:47.520
What you saw is catch.

00:03:48.060 --> 00:03:48.220
What?

00:03:49.080 --> 00:03:50.490
Catch, catch, catch, catch.

00:03:50.770 --> 00:03:53.480
Get bored of doing gymnastics alone and you should do it.

00:03:53.760 --> 00:03:53.860
No.

00:03:54.230 --> 00:03:54.430
Go.

00:04:05.500 --> 00:04:10.630
The man who loves you and waits for you.

00:04:10.630 --> 00:04:12.460
It doesn't matter if you have a golden eye.

00:04:12.660 --> 00:04:14.450
I know how to defend myself from everything.

00:04:15.070 --> 00:04:17.110
Muñe, muñe, muñe, muñe, muñe, muñe.

00:04:33.940 --> 00:04:37.160
Do you like it?

00:04:37.380 --> 00:04:41.110
Oh my God!

00:04:41.570 --> 00:04:46.500
Brother, are you up?

00:04:46.960 --> 00:04:50.820
No, I'm going to bed. Have you read?

00:04:51.630 --> 00:04:52.370
No. What?

00:04:52.780 --> 00:04:53.870
Your wedding.

00:04:54.430 --> 00:04:54.790
What?

00:04:55.460 --> 00:04:58.310
Your wedding.

00:05:00.000 --> 00:05:00.600
What did you say?

00:05:04.320 --> 00:05:09.920
He's so fast!

00:05:30.800 --> 00:05:31.400
But you don't know him.

00:05:31.860 --> 00:05:35.030
I say, who is he to announce the date of my wedding without consulting me?

00:05:35.150 --> 00:05:36.070
You ghost!

00:06:06.400 --> 00:06:07.660
...to catalogue a moron.

00:06:07.720 --> 00:06:13.570
That way, it's not an assault.

00:06:14.580 --> 00:06:16.700
Prejudice of moron or haste of a starving man.

00:06:17.260 --> 00:06:18.940
Any of the two is enough to despise him.

00:06:20.180 --> 00:06:21.220
Well, but he's your boyfriend.

00:06:22.270 --> 00:06:22.390
What?

00:06:22.710 --> 00:06:29.570
I, as a language...

00:06:30.480 --> 00:06:32.100
Thank God I've known him for a long time.

00:06:32.140 --> 00:06:33.190
What are you going to do?

00:06:33.370 --> 00:06:34.400
Can you doubt it?

00:06:34.750 --> 00:06:35.990
Coca, another scandal.

00:06:36.490 --> 00:06:39.610
Go away with that despot!

00:06:40.970 --> 00:06:41.670
But dad...

00:06:41.670 --> 00:06:43.840
Well, thank you.

00:06:43.960 --> 00:06:45.260
From North America, as always.

00:06:46.000 --> 00:06:46.720
Far from Switzerland.

00:06:47.820 --> 00:06:48.420
You're going to be here,

00:06:48.620 --> 00:06:50.100
taking care of such a bitch.

00:06:50.360 --> 00:06:51.780
How exaggerated.

00:06:52.840 --> 00:06:53.680
Hello, Antuco!

00:06:53.920 --> 00:06:55.680
Do you believe me?

00:06:56.640 --> 00:06:57.000
Pucca!

00:06:57.220 --> 00:06:57.580
What?

00:06:58.350 --> 00:06:58.650
Eh?

00:07:00.250 --> 00:07:04.420
I haven't given you that news, but when I've done something without asking you, my angel...

00:07:04.420 --> 00:07:07.740
I'm giving you the luxury, you scoundrel, of rehearsing your dominion with me!

00:07:08.530 --> 00:07:10.530
That news has been given by some infamous man who hates me!

00:07:11.470 --> 00:07:13.730
But I've been collecting poors all day with your aunt here!

00:07:13.730 --> 00:07:15.230
Ask your aunt!

00:07:31.340 --> 00:07:38.890
It's okay, don't be like that.

00:07:41.440 --> 00:07:44.180
I can't even call you.

00:07:45.470 --> 00:07:47.120
I'm so sensitive.

00:07:47.780 --> 00:07:51.190
You don't look like it.

00:07:51.530 --> 00:07:53.940
Well, I'm sensitive to the spiritual, you understand.

00:07:54.540 --> 00:07:55.600
In fact...

00:07:55.600 --> 00:07:56.220
Look at this.

00:07:56.360 --> 00:07:58.000
It's a model.

00:08:00.570 --> 00:08:02.090
You have despised me, you scoundrel!

00:08:02.780 --> 00:08:05.140
No, I don't, I'm sorry.

00:08:07.480 --> 00:08:08.800
Problems, you understand? They are problems.

00:08:09.100 --> 00:08:10.430
I can listen to you now.

00:08:10.650 --> 00:08:11.700
Shall we go downstairs then?

00:08:11.940 --> 00:08:12.120
Yes.

00:08:12.240 --> 00:08:13.880
No, here rather.

00:08:14.140 --> 00:08:15.220
That's how I'm doing the toilet.

00:08:15.580 --> 00:08:16.630
It doesn't bother you, does it?

00:08:16.770 --> 00:08:16.990
No.

00:08:17.390 --> 00:08:18.410
You're Valenciano then?

00:08:18.770 --> 00:08:18.870
Yes.

00:08:19.250 --> 00:08:22.680
Come with me, aunt, I'll tell you about Antuco.

00:08:22.820 --> 00:08:24.000
Wouldn't it be the same afterwards?

00:08:24.300 --> 00:08:25.180
Yes, aunt, or never.

00:08:25.480 --> 00:08:26.900
I say, because now the boys are in the gym.

00:08:27.260 --> 00:08:28.260
We have to give the class.

00:08:28.360 --> 00:08:29.420
No, today I can't.

00:08:29.500 --> 00:08:29.640
Yes.

00:08:31.180 --> 00:08:34.220
If they want to meet you, now is not a minute.

00:08:34.580 --> 00:08:46.870
No, you know, they help the alcoholics.

00:08:46.930 --> 00:08:48.030
Ah, they send you the drink.

00:08:48.420 --> 00:08:48.920
That's right.

00:08:49.500 --> 00:08:49.720
No.

00:08:52.140 --> 00:08:53.860
When, aunt? I can't stand it anymore.

00:09:00.570 --> 00:09:17.650
My niece, how have my creatures behaved?

00:09:17.690 --> 00:09:18.610
Very good.

00:09:23.020 --> 00:09:26.140
As a work of social protection, it will be immense.

00:09:26.700 --> 00:09:28.140
Yes, but very expensive, right?

00:09:28.390 --> 00:09:28.890
Yes.

00:09:31.820 --> 00:09:35.590
Excuse me, did you buy the mesh?

00:09:35.960 --> 00:09:37.200
Yes, ma'am.

00:09:37.360 --> 00:09:39.280
And why don't you use it? They're ugly.

00:09:39.960 --> 00:09:42.790
This group is called experimental nuclear.

00:09:43.170 --> 00:09:44.730
What are you going to do with it?

00:09:44.950 --> 00:09:46.380
We're going to bribe the government.

00:09:47.690 --> 00:09:49.350
We've decided to fight the public authorities,

00:09:50.170 --> 00:09:51.650
because they're trying to save the unemployed,

00:09:51.990 --> 00:09:53.460
by filling them with nothing but the stomach,

00:09:53.700 --> 00:09:54.810
as if they were beasts.

00:09:56.230 --> 00:09:57.470
And how are you going to solve it?

00:09:58.350 --> 00:09:59.310
With a better help.

00:10:00.410 --> 00:10:01.770
...and also reach for their salt.

00:10:03.100 --> 00:10:06.020
Here each one of these creatures receives daily...

00:10:06.020 --> 00:10:08.590
...four pesos for the meal...

00:10:08.590 --> 00:10:11.280
...and an hour of dance to raise their spirits.

00:10:12.370 --> 00:10:13.390
But they make them dance?

00:10:13.610 --> 00:10:25.600
They put...

00:10:25.600 --> 00:10:26.220
They give them heat.

00:10:26.540 --> 00:10:26.780
...natural.

00:10:27.160 --> 00:10:27.840
That's how they breathe.

00:10:28.340 --> 00:10:29.490
No, no, heat.

00:10:30.000 --> 00:10:33.000
Shame on you. You know what we looked like in the neighborhood.

00:10:33.660 --> 00:10:33.800
What?

00:10:35.210 --> 00:10:37.350
Look what they've done to this one. Show them.

00:10:37.830 --> 00:10:40.540
Yes, but have you taken them out on the street?

00:10:40.780 --> 00:10:41.670
Of course.

00:10:41.910 --> 00:10:42.950
What's happened to you?

00:10:43.130 --> 00:10:44.210
The lady told us.

00:10:48.580 --> 00:10:50.070
Lord, let them eat.

00:10:50.520 --> 00:10:53.020
I'll get ready and come back. Excuse me.

00:10:54.900 --> 00:10:58.770
It seems to me that today this piano went up and down more than yesterday.

00:10:59.270 --> 00:10:59.970
I don't want...

00:11:00.000 --> 00:11:01.310
I wish I had a record

00:11:01.310 --> 00:11:21.830
with that Rinite

00:11:21.830 --> 00:11:26.560
On the contrary, in this way he gives me a little of his intimacy

00:11:26.560 --> 00:11:29.960
that time does not reach me, Rinite

00:11:33.520 --> 00:11:35.400
Oh, I'm so lonely, for everyone.

00:11:35.740 --> 00:11:36.560
I imagine.

00:11:37.100 --> 00:11:39.680
Isn't your father going to come back yet?

00:11:41.150 --> 00:11:41.550
Esperanza!

00:11:41.610 --> 00:11:42.910
He's the crazy one in business.

00:11:43.290 --> 00:11:46.560
Especially since my mother died.

00:11:46.640 --> 00:11:49.300
With the fact that everyone here remembers her.

00:11:49.360 --> 00:11:51.010
It's been three years since we've seen him.

00:11:52.680 --> 00:11:53.020
My dear.

00:11:53.260 --> 00:11:54.180
Come in.

00:11:54.400 --> 00:11:59.740
What are we going to do with the piano?

00:12:00.160 --> 00:12:01.520
Take him to my room.

00:12:01.760 --> 00:12:05.090
All right. Does the lady know it's 5.30?

00:12:05.370 --> 00:12:06.950
Yes, but I can't stop him.

00:12:07.270 --> 00:12:11.530
I'm saying this in case the lady thinks we should let the guests into the garden.

00:12:11.750 --> 00:12:13.630
They've been waiting for a long time in the garden.

00:12:15.040 --> 00:12:29.680
I'm drunk.

00:12:32.880 --> 00:12:33.480
Yes, ma'am.

00:12:33.520 --> 00:12:36.520
Well, then, where was I?

00:12:36.760 --> 00:12:37.240
The orchestra.

00:12:37.700 --> 00:12:38.380
Let them start.

00:12:38.560 --> 00:12:39.340
Please don't leave.

00:12:39.620 --> 00:12:40.140
The firm.

00:12:40.440 --> 00:12:41.440
Oh, it's true.

00:12:42.960 --> 00:12:43.500
Come here.

00:12:44.110 --> 00:12:48.390
And so all day you see me like this?

00:12:49.010 --> 00:12:49.570
For nothing.

00:12:50.130 --> 00:12:53.610
And what a wonderful business there is to do, Ferrimi.

00:12:53.940 --> 00:12:56.360
Last night they offered me on sale the white one.

00:12:56.440 --> 00:12:57.570
What are they?

00:12:57.570 --> 00:12:59.060
They are useless.

00:13:00.000 --> 00:13:00.920
Don't say it.

00:13:01.000 --> 00:13:02.650
No, if it's worth my word.

00:13:03.760 --> 00:13:05.020
What a doubt, Ferrimi.

00:13:05.380 --> 00:13:06.690
If not, I won't do it.

00:13:07.280 --> 00:13:08.020
I say it.

00:13:08.200 --> 00:13:09.620
Holy word, Ferrimi.

00:13:09.780 --> 00:13:11.160
See you later and thank you very much.

00:13:11.520 --> 00:13:12.500
Let's see what I wear.

00:13:12.600 --> 00:13:13.160
And this is the dress.

00:13:13.520 --> 00:13:15.180
You must have ordered something new for today.

00:13:15.820 --> 00:13:16.300
It's probable.

00:13:16.800 --> 00:13:17.220
I don't know.

00:13:32.360 --> 00:13:35.000
If the gentlemen want to come in, the young lady will come down in a second.

00:13:36.960 --> 00:13:42.410
Oh, did you like it, Mr. Sondrerito?

00:13:43.180 --> 00:13:45.590
We'll have to try to find that model.

00:13:45.730 --> 00:13:46.990
I'm sure of it. He won't have slept.

00:13:47.430 --> 00:13:49.130
Oh, how beautiful!

00:13:49.970 --> 00:13:50.370
Huh?

00:13:55.600 --> 00:13:56.080
How hot!

00:14:01.170 --> 00:14:03.700
But no one has ever understood me like you.

00:14:04.160 --> 00:14:06.720
Because you know that I like flyers.

00:14:06.740 --> 00:14:09.470
He put them all on us. He didn't forget any of them.

00:15:16.510 --> 00:15:17.110
On the phone, sir.

00:15:17.270 --> 00:15:22.920
Ma'am, from Arriba to El Peñalú.

00:15:30.220 --> 00:15:33.580
The one who is celebrating today is the birthday of the dog of the lady.

00:15:35.020 --> 00:15:36.850
Oh, the dog's birthday is in August.

00:15:37.190 --> 00:15:40.890
The lady of Armen and Boez also got confused.

00:15:40.890 --> 00:15:41.130
What?

00:15:42.570 --> 00:15:43.470
Quite well.

00:15:43.930 --> 00:15:45.090
She's having a good time.

00:15:45.370 --> 00:15:48.720
There are Jerkins' dogs, Gomez's dogs...

00:15:48.720 --> 00:15:51.450
...and the Amigas' dogs.

00:15:51.450 --> 00:15:52.560
On her behalf.

00:15:53.320 --> 00:15:54.940
No, the lady hasn't come down yet.

00:15:55.180 --> 00:15:56.860
I have to go!

00:16:00.160 --> 00:16:06.850
Yes, miss.

00:16:40.450 --> 00:16:42.730
and they run away

00:16:47.700 --> 00:16:50.170
I, I

00:16:50.170 --> 00:16:53.360
Anyone, is the best way to not be with anyone

00:16:53.360 --> 00:16:55.380
What's wrong, Mrs. Antuco?

00:16:55.500 --> 00:16:56.540
No, what's wrong?

00:16:57.050 --> 00:16:58.360
Wait, I'm...

00:17:00.540 --> 00:17:19.200
Hello, Tuco. What are you doing?

00:17:25.450 --> 00:17:28.130
You're his son. I don't know if...

00:17:30.000 --> 00:17:30.220
Yes.

00:17:33.230 --> 00:17:34.230
But, of course,

00:17:34.930 --> 00:17:36.550
where there's room for doubt,

00:17:37.570 --> 00:17:39.230
there's always a pig.

00:17:39.590 --> 00:17:41.270
Oh, that's me.

00:17:42.840 --> 00:17:49.110
I've taken the name of the pig

00:17:49.110 --> 00:17:52.210
that made the news of my marriage with Coca

00:17:52.210 --> 00:17:52.370
in the address of the newspaper

00:17:52.370 --> 00:17:53.480
They told you it was me?

00:17:53.850 --> 00:17:54.030
Yes.

00:17:54.640 --> 00:17:55.100
And what do you want?

00:17:55.700 --> 00:17:57.060
That you choose the piece you want me to break?

00:17:58.270 --> 00:17:58.490
Me?

00:17:59.120 --> 00:17:59.520
This...

00:18:01.630 --> 00:18:02.770
Don't mess with me or I'll kill you!

00:18:03.400 --> 00:18:04.140
They're lying to you!

00:18:05.310 --> 00:18:06.170
What are they doing?

00:18:06.480 --> 00:18:10.240
They're so famous!

00:18:25.860 --> 00:18:27.920
Sir, Mr. Tomás Alvera is arriving tonight.

00:18:27.920 --> 00:18:28.600
Mr. Tomás?

00:18:28.720 --> 00:18:29.750
Yes, he's the administrator.

00:18:32.800 --> 00:18:33.540
I'll take the girl's one.

00:18:33.560 --> 00:18:34.120
No, wait.

00:18:34.420 --> 00:18:34.700
Me.

00:18:34.900 --> 00:18:35.640
At your places.

00:18:35.860 --> 00:18:36.700
We'll take care of it later.

00:18:36.920 --> 00:18:37.640
We'll take care of it later.

00:19:10.750 --> 00:19:25.510
Pase, pase, pase, se, se, se.

00:19:33.550 --> 00:19:35.350
Mr. Tomás Alvera arrives tonight.

00:19:35.390 --> 00:19:41.880
And what about me? And what about me? And what about me?

00:19:43.190 --> 00:19:47.460
I will thank you, sir, for answering me personally.

00:19:48.130 --> 00:19:51.510
Because a telegram has also arrived for the girl, and I present...

00:19:56.970 --> 00:19:59.960
My sister tells you that...

00:20:00.000 --> 00:20:00.360
And when will you come tonight?

00:20:00.740 --> 00:20:02.820
Would you advise me to deliver it to you?

00:20:03.060 --> 00:20:05.620
Yes, but then they make more noise and let me sleep.

00:20:05.980 --> 00:20:09.840
I love you.

00:20:11.610 --> 00:20:15.740
This telegram is for you.

00:20:25.790 --> 00:20:26.230
Mom.

00:20:30.000 --> 00:20:38.620
What are you talking about? Didn't you hear me?

00:20:39.550 --> 00:20:40.410
I'm going to jail!

00:20:47.300 --> 00:20:47.880
What are you saying?

00:20:47.920 --> 00:20:50.470
I've lived my whole life without being inspected.

00:20:50.710 --> 00:20:53.290
And now, when I have 20 days left to grow up,

00:20:53.510 --> 00:20:55.570
I have to face the presence of an administrator.

00:20:56.010 --> 00:20:57.970
I have to do something.

00:20:58.090 --> 00:20:59.510
Have you thought about it?

00:21:00.350 --> 00:21:00.490
Yes.

00:21:00.610 --> 00:21:01.250
What do you think?

00:21:01.820 --> 00:21:02.180
Nothing.

00:21:03.120 --> 00:21:03.660
It's very little.

00:21:05.540 --> 00:21:05.660
Okay.

00:21:06.700 --> 00:21:12.970
It's a lot. You would deserve it.

00:21:13.250 --> 00:21:13.370
Go.

00:21:15.540 --> 00:21:20.320
I thought you answered.

00:21:21.000 --> 00:21:21.640
Me too.

00:21:23.000 --> 00:21:26.100
But I swear I'll drive Tomás Alvera crazy, huh?

00:21:26.360 --> 00:21:28.730
It will be difficult.

00:21:30.000 --> 00:21:35.250
I was. He's the man in the bag.

00:21:35.510 --> 00:21:36.110
Show me.

00:21:36.390 --> 00:21:39.340
I remember him with the fright he gave me as a girl.

00:21:39.440 --> 00:21:41.150
To the right, which is the other way around.

00:21:42.300 --> 00:21:43.280
Man, it's like that.

00:21:43.480 --> 00:21:45.780
You go to the door and let us know. We'll be in the club.

00:21:46.080 --> 00:21:46.440
Take it.

00:21:46.580 --> 00:21:47.500
It's eight o'clock.

00:21:47.520 --> 00:21:49.520
That's why. Soon. I'm going to finish dressing.

00:22:00.380 --> 00:22:04.920
It's been a long time. I've been here since he caught me.

00:22:05.300 --> 00:22:07.880
Don't get me wrong, he's still on board.

00:22:08.580 --> 00:22:11.010
I'm telling you, no! They've all gone down.

00:22:11.670 --> 00:22:15.120
Yes, but did you look at the cages?

00:22:15.830 --> 00:22:17.600
I've already looked at them. He hasn't come.

00:22:17.920 --> 00:22:22.270
Well, I don't know. He must have forgotten.

00:22:22.750 --> 00:22:23.720
Damn it!

00:22:26.500 --> 00:22:29.620
Excuse me.

00:22:30.924 --> 00:22:31.924
Thank you.

00:23:00.990 --> 00:23:02.230
Mr. Albicante is upstairs.

00:23:02.250 --> 00:23:03.400
It can't be.

00:23:03.900 --> 00:23:04.640
No way.

00:23:05.060 --> 00:23:05.980
However, he's there.

00:23:06.670 --> 00:23:08.330
He'll be there, but he hasn't arrived.

00:23:08.790 --> 00:23:09.810
Tell him to get up soon.

00:23:10.070 --> 00:23:10.930
I have to talk to him.

00:23:11.090 --> 00:23:12.270
No, it's not necessary.

00:23:12.470 --> 00:23:12.950
See you tomorrow.

00:23:17.080 --> 00:23:19.560
The lady considers it prudent to call him at this hour.

00:23:20.030 --> 00:23:20.710
Yes, why?

00:23:21.780 --> 00:23:22.080
What?

00:23:22.720 --> 00:23:27.140
He said he saw Báscaras at the end.

00:23:27.640 --> 00:23:29.000
Yes, he was in front of the platform.

00:23:30.030 --> 00:23:31.250
I don't know how to explain it.

00:23:31.270 --> 00:23:33.330
I don't know. He must have gone down the other side.

00:23:33.690 --> 00:23:33.850
Ah!

00:23:34.290 --> 00:23:44.130
Wait a minute. No, I got dressed. He's here.

00:24:01.310 --> 00:24:01.730
Me? Nothing.

00:24:01.970 --> 00:24:02.190
Then?

00:24:02.710 --> 00:24:03.400
I don't know.

00:24:03.540 --> 00:24:05.280
I understand.

00:24:08.840 --> 00:24:10.600
Please, don't force me to do a barbarity.

00:24:11.530 --> 00:24:11.930
Don't scream!

00:24:12.170 --> 00:24:12.330
Please!

00:24:13.340 --> 00:24:13.920
I beg you!

00:24:13.980 --> 00:24:14.180
I beg you!

00:24:28.600 --> 00:24:28.860
Don't scream!

00:24:29.520 --> 00:24:29.980
I beg you!

00:24:39.280 --> 00:24:40.710
I'm in the fuckin' middle league, I romped it!

00:25:06.430 --> 00:25:07.580
Where? I don't see him.

00:25:09.740 --> 00:25:11.420
That's Tomás Alvera.

00:25:11.420 --> 00:25:11.620
What?

00:25:14.460 --> 00:25:16.960
Mr. Tomás Alvera, son of a...

00:25:21.010 --> 00:25:21.450
Nonsense.

00:25:21.750 --> 00:25:24.660
Get out of here.

00:25:24.760 --> 00:25:27.270
And you too.

00:25:27.510 --> 00:25:28.600
I want to talk to your father.

00:25:30.000 --> 00:25:30.800
No, my father didn't come.

00:25:31.060 --> 00:25:32.440
What did you say?

00:25:33.730 --> 00:25:34.730
No, he didn't come.

00:25:35.980 --> 00:25:36.280
Impossible!

00:25:36.740 --> 00:25:37.620
Yes, I'm alone.

00:25:39.570 --> 00:25:41.730
But what a shame! Shame!

00:25:44.860 --> 00:25:46.120
And no, because he had an affair.

00:25:46.340 --> 00:25:48.630
What are you talking about?

00:25:48.630 --> 00:25:50.280
What do you imagine about that indecent old man?

00:25:50.520 --> 00:25:51.460
But what are you talking about?

00:25:51.500 --> 00:25:53.080
My father didn't come because he stayed in North America.

00:25:55.470 --> 00:25:56.170
But what a thing!

00:25:56.480 --> 00:25:57.120
It was difficult.

00:25:57.800 --> 00:25:58.760
I'm not used to it.

00:25:59.330 --> 00:25:59.970
I'm very...

00:26:00.000 --> 00:26:02.420
It's natural, you know. I'm a farm guy, simple.

00:26:03.000 --> 00:26:04.440
You sell your boots far away.

00:26:06.400 --> 00:26:09.100
What's all this about, right? What do you think if we go again?

00:26:09.980 --> 00:26:14.700
I'll hit you. I mean, good night.

00:26:16.090 --> 00:26:17.690
I'm waiting for you to get off the horse.

00:26:18.110 --> 00:26:18.620
What horse?

00:26:19.490 --> 00:26:20.490
No, it comes standing.

00:26:22.610 --> 00:26:23.950
I'm Tomás Alvera, son.

00:26:24.120 --> 00:26:26.380
The administration of this house is here to intervene.

00:26:26.400 --> 00:26:27.400
Is he here to take care?

00:26:27.810 --> 00:26:28.030
Yes.

00:26:28.400 --> 00:26:29.420
Hired as a dog.

00:26:30.670 --> 00:26:33.210
He comes to watch over me and to tell my father everything.

00:26:33.310 --> 00:26:37.720
That would be more or less a mix of spy and comadre, right?

00:26:38.080 --> 00:26:40.750
A mix of dog and doggy.

00:26:41.830 --> 00:26:42.390
That's funny.

00:26:43.420 --> 00:26:45.590
For you, in your case, I would cry.

00:26:47.210 --> 00:26:48.770
This was going wrong, but it's getting worse.

00:26:49.220 --> 00:26:50.620
What do you think if we don't see each other today?

00:26:50.900 --> 00:26:54.540
Tomorrow, maybe it'll be better.

00:26:54.720 --> 00:26:58.500
Who says, maybe we pack in another way and become friends?

00:26:59.040 --> 00:26:59.440
Friends?

00:27:00.670 --> 00:27:01.290
Don't wait for him.

00:27:01.370 --> 00:27:03.150
Good night.

00:27:03.660 --> 00:27:04.100
To you.

00:27:30.000 --> 00:27:32.320
Thank you.

00:27:47.240 --> 00:27:47.520
Thank you.

00:28:10.430 --> 00:28:10.890
What is this?

00:28:10.890 --> 00:28:12.570
It's what I pointed out in my papers.

00:28:13.080 --> 00:28:14.300
But it's crazy, my God!

00:28:16.350 --> 00:28:16.990
What about that girl?

00:28:17.680 --> 00:28:18.240
She's older!

00:28:18.940 --> 00:28:19.260
The heart.

00:28:19.680 --> 00:28:23.100
Any word, any negative, gives it a lot of attacks.

00:28:23.420 --> 00:28:24.160
But they're true.

00:28:25.440 --> 00:28:26.120
But they give it...

00:28:27.100 --> 00:28:27.660
Tichoco.

00:28:29.430 --> 00:28:29.710
Cousin.

00:28:30.000 --> 00:28:31.680
He's an orphan. He's been living here since he was born.

00:28:32.420 --> 00:28:33.420
Why does he make monthly salaries?

00:28:33.660 --> 00:28:36.940
He makes music for those festivals that are held every year.

00:28:37.410 --> 00:28:38.390
And what does that produce?

00:28:39.010 --> 00:28:39.410
Deficit.

00:28:43.070 --> 00:28:43.890
93,000 pesos.

00:28:44.440 --> 00:28:46.060
Ah, that's from the kid Pocho.

00:28:46.330 --> 00:28:46.830
Does he have a biographer?

00:28:47.130 --> 00:28:49.150
No, sir. The machines for making movies.

00:28:49.940 --> 00:28:53.320
He practices acting. He plans to direct a very popular movie.

00:28:53.920 --> 00:28:55.740
To direct movies, he buys the machines.

00:28:56.560 --> 00:28:57.710
But what a thing of mine.

00:28:58.490 --> 00:28:59.830
And the oil, 30,000.

00:29:00.030 --> 00:29:03.240
and the one with the boats, 30,000, and the one with the movies, 200,000.

00:29:03.320 --> 00:29:05.980
And one, and two, and 20 pages of absurd rot.

00:29:06.460 --> 00:29:11.140
And on top of that, a stupid desire to do business that I don't understand.

00:29:11.640 --> 00:29:12.040
Heredity.

00:29:12.730 --> 00:29:15.270
Heredity! I wish my father had the ability to do business.

00:29:15.520 --> 00:29:17.640
Yes, of course, but he doesn't have the ability.

00:29:18.250 --> 00:29:19.710
All he has is desire.

00:29:20.410 --> 00:29:23.080
Yes, but he's going to lose it, because this is over.

00:29:23.440 --> 00:29:26.740
I advise you to study it, it's not to judge it, sir.

00:29:27.540 --> 00:29:28.980
There are horrible things, Isidro.

00:29:29.520 --> 00:29:29.880
the city

00:29:30.000 --> 00:29:32.910
The ideal, Mendez, is a matter of millions.

00:29:33.380 --> 00:29:36.970
Ah, no, that's the only thing that's been done so far.

00:29:37.070 --> 00:29:37.210
What?

00:29:37.610 --> 00:29:40.370
Yes, sir, serious.

00:29:41.310 --> 00:29:41.950
I'm in.

00:29:42.540 --> 00:29:44.120
I've bought it and I'm happy.

00:29:45.040 --> 00:29:46.140
It's very far away, it's true.

00:29:46.600 --> 00:29:49.810
But to assure the age is so much.

00:29:51.600 --> 00:29:53.620
She hasn't seen the photos.

00:29:54.160 --> 00:29:54.880
There are thousands.

00:29:55.310 --> 00:29:57.010
And agencies, ponies.

00:29:57.530 --> 00:29:57.870
And...

00:29:57.870 --> 00:29:58.610
But what has she put?

00:29:59.040 --> 00:29:59.980
The back of her...

00:30:00.000 --> 00:30:02.280
...that has given the company a great boost.

00:30:02.600 --> 00:30:03.440
But money?

00:30:03.950 --> 00:30:06.590
No, he doesn't have any. Even his majority...

00:30:06.590 --> 00:30:07.410
And sign documents?

00:30:07.830 --> 00:30:08.500
No way.

00:30:09.210 --> 00:30:11.270
What are these receipts, 22,000 pesos?

00:30:11.650 --> 00:30:12.290
I'll show you.

00:30:12.510 --> 00:30:13.050
Were they necessary?

00:30:13.570 --> 00:30:16.790
Mr. Tichoco's room was turned twice for the acoustics.

00:30:17.350 --> 00:30:19.850
And the blue room is being transformed into a fishmonger...

00:30:19.850 --> 00:30:21.520
...because now the lady wants to fish.

00:30:24.240 --> 00:30:29.440
Show me. There will be a film producer here.

00:30:30.730 --> 00:30:32.270
Put it on the projector, we'll be right back.

00:30:32.570 --> 00:30:33.450
Show me the reflections.

00:31:17.150 --> 00:31:18.450
There is no permission to show the gentleman.

00:31:18.910 --> 00:31:21.230
You know there is no permission when I am reconciling myself.

00:31:21.350 --> 00:31:21.830
Excuse me.

00:31:21.830 --> 00:31:22.710
Look for the receipts.

00:31:23.640 --> 00:31:26.160
Go to that idiot of administrator who has arrived.

00:31:26.540 --> 00:31:28.510
That idiot is me.

00:31:38.030 --> 00:31:39.990
He's crazy, that guy. What's wrong with him?

00:31:40.220 --> 00:31:43.050
No, when I shake him in emotion, he stays like that.

00:31:45.500 --> 00:31:47.020
Then you should shake him in another way.

00:31:47.240 --> 00:31:47.860
No, please.

00:31:49.280 --> 00:31:50.440
Don't even think about it.

00:31:50.800 --> 00:31:53.800
The doctors seem to have told him that it could be fatal.

00:31:54.240 --> 00:31:55.160
What do you tell me?

00:31:55.480 --> 00:31:57.900
Neither see nor hear, Father.

00:31:58.690 --> 00:31:58.850
No?

00:32:00.860 --> 00:32:01.540
What a thing!

00:32:01.800 --> 00:32:04.890
This is where they are going to build the fishmonger.

00:32:08.590 --> 00:32:11.320
And what was here before?

00:32:11.700 --> 00:32:12.360
The library.

00:32:25.530 --> 00:32:26.130
Also, sir.

00:32:26.430 --> 00:32:29.140
What a thing!

00:32:30.250 --> 00:32:32.760
You son of a bitch!

00:33:01.980 --> 00:33:03.240
And that?

00:33:03.600 --> 00:33:05.420
The one about the core of Mrs. China.

00:33:05.760 --> 00:33:07.820
Ah, the one about the heart.

00:33:08.120 --> 00:33:10.480
You know me, don't you?

00:33:10.520 --> 00:33:18.650
What are you talking about?

00:33:18.770 --> 00:33:20.190
I don't know her.

00:33:20.350 --> 00:33:22.060
But how? You still...

00:33:22.060 --> 00:33:22.780
No, I don't know her.

00:33:23.040 --> 00:33:24.240
Oh, come on, sir.

00:33:31.920 --> 00:33:33.600
There is no right to the heart!

00:34:02.240 --> 00:34:03.340
I'll see you next time.

00:34:30.220 --> 00:34:32.200
I want you to listen to your father.

00:34:32.360 --> 00:34:33.240
Is he talking on the radio?

00:34:33.340 --> 00:34:35.340
No, he sent you a movie he filmed for you.

00:34:35.480 --> 00:34:38.100
With a greeting and some things that you should remember.

00:34:38.460 --> 00:34:40.310
It's already on the projector. Come and listen.

00:34:43.260 --> 00:34:44.600
When the gentlemen turn.

00:34:49.360 --> 00:34:52.140
Son, dear son.

00:34:53.790 --> 00:34:54.090
Father.

00:34:54.980 --> 00:34:55.940
Son of my soul.

00:34:56.770 --> 00:34:59.770
Friends, real servants to whom I owe so much.

00:35:00.000 --> 00:35:02.650
Oh, nothing, sir.

00:35:03.090 --> 00:35:08.950
Above all, to my supporters in South America.

00:35:11.260 --> 00:35:15.650
How exciting!

00:35:16.580 --> 00:35:20.340
And to you, dear daughter.

00:35:20.700 --> 00:35:26.860
The immense damage you have achieved has intensified.

00:35:30.920 --> 00:35:57.100
I can't, these things don't seem to work for me, that's why, slowly, if the Lord listens to me and studies it, it will come to dominate, but listen.

00:36:00.380 --> 00:36:01.260
Don't be like this.

00:36:01.440 --> 00:36:02.860
You've come to betray me.

00:36:02.860 --> 00:36:03.340
No, I haven't.

00:36:03.480 --> 00:36:06.360
Yes, you've brought everything I needed to get rid of my authority.

00:36:06.620 --> 00:36:10.120
You can be proud, because in this house everyone knows that I'm nothing more.

00:36:10.260 --> 00:36:11.950
What a shame, God!

00:36:12.250 --> 00:36:14.690
Let me be your friend.

00:36:14.810 --> 00:36:15.050
Friend?

00:36:18.190 --> 00:36:19.490
Yes, I want to be your friend.

00:36:19.810 --> 00:36:20.890
What you have to do is leave.

00:36:21.150 --> 00:36:22.810
I would leave, I swear, but I already said my word.

00:36:23.090 --> 00:36:23.790
You're going to lose her here.

00:36:23.850 --> 00:36:25.670
I assure you that she won't be able to stand me.

00:36:25.850 --> 00:36:26.810
Don't challenge me.

00:36:26.890 --> 00:36:27.530
Let's be friends.

00:36:28.360 --> 00:36:29.880
It's your mistakes that have brought me here.

00:36:30.250 --> 00:36:33.670
When not? Vanity comes to save me.

00:36:33.830 --> 00:36:37.080
And who will save you? I can't stand that you send me.

00:36:37.240 --> 00:36:41.710
It is necessary to submit to a disciplined plan.

00:36:42.530 --> 00:36:43.130
Wretched rich.

00:36:43.690 --> 00:36:46.190
Wealth should not be an insult, but a reward.

00:36:46.430 --> 00:36:47.700
Do I deserve it?

00:36:47.870 --> 00:36:50.350
No, because you hurt. You lack the sense of order.

00:36:50.610 --> 00:36:52.320
I live my life, the life I feel.

00:36:52.680 --> 00:36:53.300
That is your mistake.

00:36:53.540 --> 00:36:56.790
For you, who is a curtsy, you understand the old life.

00:36:56.870 --> 00:36:59.530
You are used to the drum, of course.

00:37:00.000 --> 00:37:00.640
Farmyard!

00:37:00.660 --> 00:37:04.600
Times are different.

00:37:04.760 --> 00:37:06.940
You must be different too. I trust you, I wait.

00:37:07.220 --> 00:37:09.220
Well, it's very bad. I'm the one you see.

00:37:09.360 --> 00:37:10.480
No, you must be much better.

00:37:11.130 --> 00:37:11.990
I live my time.

00:37:12.420 --> 00:37:15.000
You spend your time on top of it, without touching it.

00:37:15.140 --> 00:37:16.980
Look, Juan, let's make peace.

00:37:17.950 --> 00:37:18.890
Careful, you step on it.

00:37:18.950 --> 00:37:19.110
What?

00:37:19.510 --> 00:37:20.090
A ring.

00:37:20.470 --> 00:37:26.030
Oh, and you touch it.

00:37:26.270 --> 00:37:27.230
And what do you have? A saint.

00:37:27.690 --> 00:37:28.910
Oh, what a thing.

00:37:29.050 --> 00:37:29.890
Why, if it's more...

00:37:30.160 --> 00:37:31.500
Well, come with us, Grillo.

00:37:31.600 --> 00:37:33.140
Make some noise in this little hall, see?

00:37:33.420 --> 00:37:36.360
And they think they sing, like so many people.

00:37:37.030 --> 00:37:37.910
And I love them very much.

00:37:38.150 --> 00:37:39.690
Don't cry, eh?

00:37:39.730 --> 00:37:40.110
No.

00:37:41.400 --> 00:37:49.410
I see, you didn't introduce yourself.

00:37:49.950 --> 00:37:51.530
It's not Mirta Miralles.

00:37:51.650 --> 00:37:52.150
Yes, why?

00:38:04.250 --> 00:38:04.650
What administrator?

00:38:05.070 --> 00:38:06.570
But, girl, what administrator?

00:38:07.150 --> 00:38:08.210
Didn't you lend it to her?

00:38:08.210 --> 00:38:09.920
She goes to the books very upset.

00:38:10.160 --> 00:38:10.940
Is he your boyfriend?

00:38:11.500 --> 00:38:12.440
Please, girls.

00:38:12.640 --> 00:38:13.560
He's paid here.

00:38:13.800 --> 00:38:14.500
He's almost a servant.

00:38:15.000 --> 00:38:16.160
Oh, what a fire service!

00:38:16.500 --> 00:38:18.980
The sun!

00:38:19.710 --> 00:38:21.370
I know you've seen him.

00:38:21.590 --> 00:38:29.460
But come.

00:38:30.820 --> 00:38:31.600
No, of my love.

00:38:32.120 --> 00:38:39.430
Can the girls come to rehearse?

00:38:39.570 --> 00:38:43.720
What are they going to come? They are all crazy after the executioner.

00:38:43.960 --> 00:38:57.940
I know that tomorrow is no longer a nightmare that makes you dream.

00:39:00.350 --> 00:39:08.380
I'm waiting for you, I'm waiting for you, I'm waiting for you, I'm waiting for you to be mine

00:39:33.550 --> 00:39:35.910
Tomorrow, open your window,

00:39:36.080 --> 00:39:45.090
I know you will come to me.

00:39:45.630 --> 00:39:59.980
I know you will come to me.

00:40:01.660 --> 00:40:28.140
Instead of smiling, we'd like to cry for you, baby.

00:40:30.120 --> 00:40:31.190
I can't believe it

00:40:31.280 --> 00:40:50.590
I want a cow

00:40:50.590 --> 00:40:59.460
You can't know that

00:41:00.000 --> 00:41:01.460
Because I haven't published it yet.

00:41:01.460 --> 00:41:03.020
Maybe you haven't, but the author has.

00:41:03.500 --> 00:41:06.140
You will know.

00:41:06.990 --> 00:41:09.010
The lady calls you, Mr. Alvera.

00:41:09.030 --> 00:41:09.740
Excuse me.

00:41:11.240 --> 00:41:12.520
No, no, it's worth it, yes.

00:41:13.820 --> 00:41:14.940
I have to do the distribution.

00:41:15.220 --> 00:41:17.050
But what is the distribution?

00:41:22.500 --> 00:41:23.080
It's the rule.

00:41:24.200 --> 00:41:25.120
Why don't you want it?

00:41:25.710 --> 00:41:27.930
Go down with the tail, with pearls.

00:41:30.060 --> 00:41:30.360
What's that?

00:41:30.500 --> 00:41:31.210
A cow.

00:41:31.490 --> 00:41:32.760
I see.

00:41:33.120 --> 00:41:34.120
Do you want it in your room?

00:41:35.420 --> 00:41:35.780
I don't understand.

00:41:36.100 --> 00:41:37.010
Oh, it's very simple.

00:41:37.210 --> 00:41:40.110
I wanted to surround him with an environment that is familiar to him.

00:41:40.150 --> 00:41:41.570
That way he doesn't miss the farm.

00:41:42.410 --> 00:41:42.810
Look...

00:41:44.180 --> 00:41:45.020
I can't take it anymore.

00:41:45.020 --> 00:41:46.280
At last! Go away!

00:41:46.540 --> 00:41:46.800
No!

00:41:46.960 --> 00:41:48.030
I'm not leaving!

00:41:48.210 --> 00:41:48.350
Please!

00:41:49.280 --> 00:41:49.680
I'm tired!

00:41:50.120 --> 00:41:50.990
I'm not leaving!

00:41:51.230 --> 00:41:53.580
I wanted to be his friend, and friend of all!

